ulating's domain projection.\"},\"moved(bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Whether articulation has continued past the current head.\"},\"pair(bytes32,bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"[utterance, articulating]: an utterance articulated over a further one.\"},\"utter(bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"The innermost articulation: a bare utterance \\u2014 the recursion's floor.\"}},\"notice\":\"The base morphism: recursively the pair [utterance, articulating],         bottoming out at an innermost utterance of admitted marks. One-way \\u2014         no arrow returns to a pre-relational state; a node, once witnessed,         is never unmade. This is the second and last place free acts enter:         below Articulating, nothing is free.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"lib/solidity/Articulating.sol\":\"Articulating\"},\"evmVersion\":\"prague\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[],\"viaIR\":true},\"sources\":{\"lib/solidity/Articulating.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x559e2079c7bc502a6db89424a6a0a8714d399fe81ec22f97a19b6b760e6f9673\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://3c246079e8f0df3ccdb1f0c918118b2d20f679e3d631027287fcda44ee2429e5\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmYK6KBX3Y8ox3yu7USr2xszngMheKmBfwHxLzupEF9YD2\"]},\"lib/solidity/Mark.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xcb5ee0ebf5aaa8b0279d9de64184b0e306b3154236f4eafaf735269cb1e86e77\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://7c4912964a116b7be0de5bf0021c05443c6135b3692d205a1fc8a7b17b0bf971\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmSmec9XAFRgG6411BxxseYCbum1kN4ZkYm6DXAzabawwp\"]},\"lib/solidity/Utterance.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x606fe5ac3f68b5315b508e1bfc018853078937a265c30978b083da53092f8c37\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://c07a4b3bb97052f7dd0c083666b4a06751548f1eb8cd85b5e72df5c1cac1acf2\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmVcMe9CwxScJErVk1ep9BMpuhj5nqwaCBoMbeaoAF2q5Y\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.28+commit.7893614a"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"inter